# FIXTURE schema (not game data): shape of Teario `runs.csv` (TEARIO plan section 6), a subset of its columns.
TABLE | teario_runs.csv | one row per run
COL | run_id | id |  | run id
COL | level_hash | id |  | hash of the level file the run played
COL | driver | category |  | human or bot
COL | ticks | measure | ticks | run length
COL | result | category |  | clear or died
COL | score | measure | points | score
COL | coins | measure | coins | coins
COL | stomps | measure | count | enemies stomped
COL | deaths | measure | count | deaths in the run
COL | time_left | measure | ticks | clock left at the end
COL | input_rows | measure | rows | input rows in the run ledger
